\item \Cref{ch:radiative} gives the finite-depth one-loop effective potential, its ultraviolet growth, and a modulus completion.
\item \Cref{ch:assessment} states what the analysis establishes and what still prevents a fundamental-physics claim.
\end{enumerate}

